<section class="shell detail"><a class="back" href="/#features">← Back to the toolkit</a><p class="eyebrow"><%= @feature['group'] %> / FEATURE WALKTHROUGH</p><h1><%= @feature['title'] %></h1><p class="lead"><%= @feature['tagline'] %></p><% if @video %><div class="video-panel"><%= render "video_player", video: @video, title: "#{@feature['title']} walkthrough", introduction: false %></div><% else %><div class="video-panel pending"><span aria-hidden="true">▷</span><h2>A walkthrough is on the way.</h2><p>In the meantime, explore the commands below.</p></div><% end %><div class="section-heading"><h2>Try it in your terminal.</h2><p>Examples to help you find your next step.<br>Check installed help before changing records.</p></div><% @feature['commands'].each do |command| %><article class="command-example"><p><%= command['what'] %></p><pre><code><%= command['cmd'] %></code></pre></article><% end %><a href="/docs/install/">Need a hand getting started? Read the setup guide →</a></section>
